### create building
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/buildings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pavillon principal",
  "city": "Montréal"
}

### get all buildings
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/buildings

### get health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health
### get specific building
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/buildings/2